<title>UK: EIS sales and orders up in first five months.</title>
<headline>EIS sales and orders up in first five months.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Engineering firm EIS Group Plc said on Tuesday that orders and sales in the first five months of the current year were ahead of last year.</p>
<p>&quot;Our aim is to improve overall margins, create strong products positions and reduce gearing,&quot; EIS Chairman Norman Wooding told shareholders at the company's annual meeting.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
